  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-8" contextRef="c-1">Respondent is engaged in the transportation of natural gas in the states of Colorado, Idaho, New Mexico, Oregon, Utah, Washington, and Wyoming and In natural gas storage in the states of Utah and Washington.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
