      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:105%">Evergreen - 25 Year costs related to 18,256 Dth per day of vintage capacity are not included. The total cost of service related to the vintage capacity is approximately $1.7 million.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:10pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%">The information contained on this page excludes regulatory assets. See FERC Form 2, page 232 - "Other Regulatory Assets (Account 182.3)" for this additional information.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:10pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">This project has an additional incremental fuel rate. We retained 106,035 Dth of gas from our shippers in 2024.</span>
