    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-13" id="fn-13" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Relates to the establishment of a regulatory liability as a result of the Tax Cut and Jobs Act enacted on December 22, 2017. Pursuant to Docket No. RP22-1155, which was approved by FERC on November 15, 2022, this liability has been netted with existing regulatory liabilities and assets.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-14" id="fn-14" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:105%">Pursuant to Exhibit E of Northwest's Stipulation and Settlement Agreement filed in Docket No. RP17-346 as approved by FERC in Northwest Pipeline LLC 160 FERC 61,008 (2017).</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-15" id="fn-15" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Relates to the establishment of a regulatory liability due to the merger of Williams with Williams Partners L.P. in August 2018 which resulted in a decrease to the effective state income tax rate. Pursuant to Docket No. RP22-1155, which was approved by FERC on November 15, 2022, this liability has been netted with existing regulatory liabilities and assets.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-16" id="fn-16" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
